{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港周三（11日）天晴乾燥，早上稍涼，市區最低氣溫約18°C，新界再低幾度。日間最高氣溫約25°C。吹和緩北至東北風。本周後期氣溫回升，周五（13日）稍後及周六（14日）初時有幾陣驟雨。下周日（15日）短暫時間有陽光。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:01:46.966145+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T12:51:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:45:03.384061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:09.211170+00:00","content_hash":"5cf6950902712fd2298e830d19b299ffa6413a15c4406a63e1eae821320fe0a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}